{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_014","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 215","char_start":4353,"char_end":4383,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_015","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Create a new offer to either buy or sell a non-fungible token (NFT) . You can only offer to sell NFTs you own or buy NFTs you don&#x27;t own.","location_hint":"paragraph 227","char_start":4651,"char_end":4792,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_016","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"If successful, the transaction creates a NFTokenOffer object . To complete the sale and change ownership of the NFT, the offer must be accepted using an NFTokenAcceptOffer transaction .","location_hint":"paragraph 228","char_start":4794,"char_end":4979,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_017","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Requires the NonFungibleTokensV1_1 amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 229","char_start":4981,"char_end":5038,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_018","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Example NFTokenCreateOffer JSON","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":5040,"char_end":5071,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_019","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"{\n\"TransactionType\" : \"NFTokenCreateOffer\" ,\n\"Account\" : \"rs8jBmmfpwgmrSPgwMsh7CvKRmRt1JTVSX\" ,\n\"NFTokenID\" : \"000100001E962F495F07A990F4ED55ACCFEEF365DBAA76B6A048C0A200000007\" ,\n\"Amount\" : \"1000000\" ,\n\"Flags\" : 1\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 231","char_start":5077,"char_end":5292,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_020","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"In addition to the common fields , NFTokenCreateOffer transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5348,"char_end":5440,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_021","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5444,"char_end":5485,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_022","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Owner String AccountID (Optional) Who owns the corresponding NFToken . If the offer is to buy a token, this field must be present and it must be different than the Account field (since an offer to buy a token one already holds is meaningless). If the offer is to sell a token, this field must not be present, as the owner is, implicitly, the same as the Account (since an offer to sell a token one doesn&#x27;t already hold is meaningless).","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5489,"char_end":5929,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_023","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"NFTokenID String UInt256 Identifies the NFToken object that the offer references.","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":5931,"char_end":6012,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_024","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Amount Currency Amount Amount Indicates the amount expected or offered for the corresponding NFToken . The amount must be non-zero, except where this is an offer to sell and the asset is XRP; then, it is legal to specify an amount of zero, which means that the current owner of the token is giving it away, gratis, either to anyone at all, or to the account identified by the Destination field.","location_hint":"paragraph 238","char_start":6014,"char_end":6408,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_025","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Expiration Number UInt32 (Optional) Time after which the offer is no longer active, in seconds since the Ripple Epoch .","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":6410,"char_end":6529,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_026","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Destination String AccountID (Optional) If present, indicates that this offer may only be accepted by the specified account. Attempts by other accounts to accept this offer MUST fail.","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":6531,"char_end":6714,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_027","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Transactions of the NFTokenCreateOffer type support additional values in the Flags field , as follows:","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":6744,"char_end":6846,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_028","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Description","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":6850,"char_end":6895,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_029","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tfSellNFToken 0x00000001 1 If enabled, indicates that the offer is a sell offer. Otherwise, it is a buy offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6899,"char_end":7009,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_030","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, NFTokenCreateOffer transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":7026,"char_end":7164,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_031","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"temDISABLED The NonFungibleTokensV1 amendment is not enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 248","char_start":7194,"char_end":7255,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_032","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"temBAD_AMOUNT The Amount field is not valid. For example, the amount was zero for a buy offer, or the amount is denominated in fungible tokens but the NFToken has the lsfOnlyXRP flag enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 249","char_start":7257,"char_end":7448,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_033","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"temBAD_EXPIRATION The specified Expiration time is invalid (for example, 0 ).","location_hint":"paragraph 250","char_start":7450,"char_end":7527,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_034","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecDIR_FULL The sender already owns too many objects in the ledger, or there are already too many offers to buy or sell this token.\nThis error is effectively impossible to receive if","location_hint":"paragraph 251","char_start":7529,"char_end":7711,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_035","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Requires the fixDirectoryLimit . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 252","char_start":7713,"char_end":7756,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_036","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecEXPIRED The specified Expiration time has already passed.","location_hint":"paragraph 254","char_start":7771,"char_end":7831,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_037","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecFROZEN The Amount is denominated in fungible tokens, but one of the trust lines that would receive tokens from this offer is frozen . This could be the seller&#x27;s trust line or the NFToken &#x27;s issuer&#x27;s trust line (if the NFToken has a transfer fee).","location_hint":"paragraph 255","char_start":7833,"char_end":8097,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_038","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecINSUFFICIENT_RESERVE The sender does not have enough XRP to meet the reserve requirement after placing this offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 256","char_start":8099,"char_end":8216,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_039","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecNO_DST The account specified in the Destination field does not exist in the ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 257","char_start":8218,"char_end":8304,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_040","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecNO_ENTRY The NFToken is not owned by the expected account.","location_hint":"paragraph 258","char_start":8306,"char_end":8367,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_041","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecNO_ISSUER The issuer specified in the Amount field does not exist.","location_hint":"paragraph 259","char_start":8369,"char_end":8438,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_042","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecNO_LINE The Amount field is denominated in fungible tokens, but the NFToken &#x27;s issuer does not have a trust line for those tokens and the NFToken does not have the lsfTrustLine flag enabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 260","char_start":8440,"char_end":8638,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_043","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecNO_PERMISSION The Destination account blocks incoming NFTokenOffers.","location_hint":"paragraph 261","char_start":8640,"char_end":8711,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_044","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 262","char_start":8713,"char_end":8765,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_045","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tecUNFUNDED_OFFER For a buy offer, the sender does have the funds specified in the Amount field available. If the Amount is XRP, this could be due to the reserve requirement; if the Amount is denominated in fungible tokens, this could be because they are frozen .","location_hint":"paragraph 263","char_start":8769,"char_end":9032,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_046","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"tefNFTOKEN_IS_NOT_TRANSFERABLE The NFToken has the lsfTransferable flag disabled and this transaction would not transfer the NFToken to or from the issuer.","location_hint":"paragraph 264","char_start":9034,"char_end":9189,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_71ee1ec187f7_047","source_id":"src_71ee1ec187f7","source_hash":"c2af81b11c23ecdcc77ba7dc406a36a6c3c9f534f6001a250f381f0478860c58","text":"Previous page NFTokenCancelOffer","location_hint":"paragraph 271","char_start":9308,"char_end":9340,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T20:20:05.102Z"}
